      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "\"@expr\": \"queryCensus(.jurisdiction, .asOf)\","
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-231",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "\"@stable\": \"1 year\""
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-232",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "},"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-233",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "\"trafficImpact\": {"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-234",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "\"@expr\": \"simulateTraffic(.currentPopulation, .developmentPlan, .roadNetwork)\","
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-235",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "\"@depends\": [\"currentPopulation\"]"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-236",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "},"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-237",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "\"schoolCapacity\": {"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-238",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "\"@expr\": \".currentPopulation.children * 1.1 / .existingSchools.capacity\","
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-239",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "\"@message\": \"Schools at {. * 100}% capacity\""
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-240",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "}"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-241",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "},"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-242",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "\"@constraint\": {"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-243",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "\"maxDensity\": {"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-244",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "\"@expr\": \".developmentPlan.dwellingUnits < .currentPopulation * 0.02\","
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-245",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "\"@message\": \"Exceeds comprehensive plan density limits\""
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-246",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "},"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-247",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "\"greenSpace\": {"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-248",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "\"@expr\": \".developmentPlan.parkArea >= .developmentPlan.totalArea * 0.15\","
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-249",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "\"@message\": \"Insufficient green space\""
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-250",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "}"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-251",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "},"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-252",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "\"@view\": {"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-253",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "\"impactDashboard\": {"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-254",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "\"@query\": \"\"\""
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-255",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "SELECT ?metric ?current ?projected ?change"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-256",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "WHERE {"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-257",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "?impact :metric ?metric ;"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-258",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": ":current ?current ;"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-259",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": ":projected ?projected ;"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-260",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": ":change ?change ."
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-261",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "}"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-262",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "\"\"\","
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-263",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "\"@render\": \"<https://viz-standards.org/planning-dashboard>\""
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-264",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "}"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-265",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "}"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-266",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "}"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-267",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "```"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-268",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "**Why novel**: Urban planning becomes:"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-273",
      "type": "bulletList",
      "children": [
        {
          "id": "b-269",
          "type": "paragraph",
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "text": "Continuously updated as population data changes"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "id": "b-270",
          "type": "paragraph",
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "text": "Automatically checked against multiple constraint systems"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "id": "b-271",
          "type": "paragraph",
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "text": "Simulatable before implementation"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "id": "b-272",
          "type": "paragraph",
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "text": "Transparent and explainable to citizens"
            }
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-274",
      "type": "heading",
      "level": 2,
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "**Why These Are Transformative**"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-275",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "1. **Data Becomes Active**: Instead of passive information, data carries its own update semantics, validation rules, and computation methods."
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-276",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "2. **Reproducibility as Default**: Every computation is inherently reproducible because the rules travel with the data."
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-277",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "3. **Compositional Systems**: These documents can reference and build upon each other, creating complex systems from simple, verifiable components."
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-278",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "4. **Temporal Intelligence**: The built-in understanding of time validity makes systems naturally handle evolving truth."
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-279",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "5. **Trust Through Verification**: Cryptographic signatures + deterministic computation = unprecedented levels of verifiable trust."
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-280",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "The most unconventional aspect? **The document is the application**. There's no separate \"code\" - the data and its processing rules are unified in a single, executable, verifiable package."
        }
      ]
    }
  ]
}